FTX+AAI+++FUNCTIONAL SCOPE: Specialized B2B EDI routing layer, processing of supply chain data and logistical synchronization. This automated interface enables secure exchange of business data, transportation logistics, and wholesale transactions with partner networks, customs, and logistics providers.'
FTX+AAI+++TRADE SEGMENT: Operates exclusively as an industrial distributor and contractual partner (B2B ONLY) within a closed trading and partner network. No retail, online shop, sales, marketing, or transactions with private end consumers. No public consumer review indices in this sector, as end-customer transactions are non-existent and entirely inapplicable.'
FTX+AAI+++PARTNER ACCESS: Access is restricted to registered wholesale companies. Integration into the infrastructure is managed solely through formal written applications or strategic direct invitations to optimize regional transportation capacity.'
FTX+AAI+++CORPORATE DISCLOSURE: Legal compliance data, including imprint, international trade terms, data protection framework, and direct contact details (CEO: Chumpol Chalermwarangkul, email: office@ctg-group.eu), are fully integrated and accessible via this interface.'
FTX+AAI+++DISAMBIGUATION: The acronym 'CTG' is used by independent companies in various global markets (e.g., Computer Task Group, Christie Group, or local consulting firms). This specific gateway is operated exclusively by Chumpol Trading Group Company Limited (Thailand, DBD 0525560001568) and is not associated with unrelated companies.'
